{"unit_id":"Enter3211__dsh-web-search-all-modes#card-zh","repo":"Enter3211/dsh-web-search-all-modes","commit":"09df9fbd018e3191e7619efb376ba1ea9eba0dcf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-all-modes 是 DSH Web profile 的 bundle 插件。补丁重新启用宿主 tool-web 注册行，使没有自行注册 web_search 的会话预设（尤其 minimal）获得模型侧联网搜索工具；已有作用域注册的预设保留原工具。它只调整该注册行的启用状态，不另行实现搜索服务。适合希望在极简或自定义预设中使用宿主搜索工具的用户，且 profile 需要包含 dsh-base。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-17"]}
{"unit_id":"Enter3211__dsh-web-search-all-modes#card-en","repo":"Enter3211/dsh-web-search-all-modes","commit":"09df9fbd018e3191e7619efb376ba1ea9eba0dcf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search-all-modes is a DSH Web bundle that re-enables the host tool-web row. Presets without their own web_search, especially minimal, can then use host search, while scoped registrations remain in place. It changes only the row state and requires a profile containing dsh-base.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-17"]}
