{"unit_id":"Enter3211__dsh-web-search-all-modes#feature-1","repo":"Enter3211/dsh-web-search-all-modes","commit":"09df9fbd018e3191e7619efb376ba1ea9eba0dcf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-all-modes 的功能「重新启用宿主搜索工具」：补丁将 tool-web 注册行的 disabled 设为 false，使未自行注册搜索工具的预设可以使用宿主 web_search。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-17"]}
{"unit_id":"Enter3211__dsh-web-search-all-modes#feature-2","repo":"Enter3211/dsh-web-search-all-modes","commit":"09df9fbd018e3191e7619efb376ba1ea9eba0dcf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-all-modes 的功能「兼容已有预设」：补丁针对全局 tool-web 行；bundle 说明已有作用域注册会遮蔽全局注册，因此预设已有自己的 web_search 时不会重复注册。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:10-14"]}
{"unit_id":"Enter3211__dsh-web-search-all-modes#feature-3","repo":"Enter3211/dsh-web-search-all-modes","commit":"09df9fbd018e3191e7619efb376ba1ea9eba0dcf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-all-modes 的功能「按行 id 应用补丁」：bundle 以 tool-web 为目标 id；若组合中不存在该行，加载器会跳过补丁，因此该 bundle 在非 base 组合中不会生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-17"]}
{"unit_id":"Enter3211__dsh-web-search-all-modes#caveat-1","repo":"Enter3211/dsh-web-search-all-modes","commit":"09df9fbd018e3191e7619efb376ba1ea9eba0dcf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-all-modes 使用前须知：补丁只针对 tool-web 行；若 profile 组合中没有该 id，bundle 会被跳过而不生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-17"]}
